ith_alter_table_with_nemesis on YB version 2.27.0.0-b552 with the PG connector. The crash occurs due to a null pointer dereference when calling CDCStateTable::GetTable, which attempts to acquire a shared lock on a nullptr mutex.\n```\nthread #1, name = 'yb-tserver', stop reason = signal SIGSEGV\n  * frame #0: 0x00007f0ab7c8d474 libc.so.6`__pthread_mutex_lock@GLIBC_2.2.5 + 4\n    frame #1: 0x000055b03c42d9df yb-tserver`std::__1::__shared_mutex_base::lock_shared() + 15\n    frame #2: 0x000055b03c595406 yb-tserver`yb::cdc::CDCStateTable::GetTable() [inlined] std::__1::shared_mutex::lock_shared[abi:ne190100](this=0x0000000000000000) at shared_mutex:206:20\n    frame #3: 0x000055b03c5953fe yb-tserver`yb::cdc::CDCStateTable::GetTable() [inlined] std::__1::shared_lock<std::__1::shared_mutex>::shared_lock[abi:ne190100](this=<unavailable>, __m=0x0000000000000000) at shared_mutex:322:11\n    frame #4: 0x000055b03c5953fe yb-tserver`yb::cdc::CDCStateTable::GetTable() [inlined] yb::SharedLock<std::__1::shared_mutex>::SharedLock(this=<unavailable>, mutex=0x0000000000000000) at shared_lock.h:26:61\n    frame #5: 0x000055b03c5953fe yb-tserver`yb::cdc::CDCStateTable::GetTable(this=0x0000000000000000) at cdc_state_table.cc:526:16\n    frame #6: 0x000055b03c59cccd yb-tserver`yb::cdc::CDCStateTable::TryFetchEntry(this=0x0000000000000000, key=0x00007efa69175390, field_filter=<unavailable>) at cdc_state_table.cc:686:20\n    frame #7: 0x000055b03c545ad5 yb-tserver`yb::cdc::CDCServiceImpl::GetLastActiveTime(this=<unavailable>, producer_tablet=0x00007efa69175900, ignore_cache=<unavailable>) at cdc_service.cc:4271:20\n    frame #8: 0x000055b03c543ad8 yb-tserver`yb::cdc::CDCServiceImpl::CheckTabletNotOfInterest(this=0x000011093fc5f020, producer_tablet=0x00007efa69175900, last_active_time_passed=0, deletion_check=<unavailable>) at cdc_service.cc:4197:33\n```\n\n### Source connector version\n\nquay.io/yugabyte/ybdb-debezium:dz.2.5.2.yb.2024.2.5\n\n### Connector configuration\n\n add connector c